<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Mobile Truck Repair in Los Angeles</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #fdf6ec;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 1000px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 20px;
      border: 2px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .top-image img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .map-and-text {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .map {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 280px;
    }
    .map img {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 6px;
    }
    .text-blocks {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 280px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 15px;
    }
    .text-block {
      background-color: #555;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 16px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #3ab4f2;
      color: white;
      font-weight: bold;
      padding: 15px 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-align: center;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin-top: auto;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background-color: #2b92c4;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="top-image">
      <img src="/img/truck-main.jpg" alt="Mobile Truck Repair in Los Angeles" />
    </div>

    <div class="map-and-text">
      <div class="map">
        <img src="/img/map.jpg" alt="Service area map" />
      </div>
      <div class="text-blocks">
        <div class="text-block">
          We will come to your breakdown location within Los Angeles County plus 150 mi
        </div>
        <div class="text-block">
          Our top-class mechanics will perform any necessary work.
        </div>
        <div class="text-block">
          We will quickly and efficiently repair your truck
        </div>
        <a href="form.html" class="button">CALCULATE THE REPAIR COST 💰</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>